WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:01.390
(adventurous music)

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:04.493
- [Will] I'm throwing
myself into the unknown.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.960
- I almost guarantee
you're going to survive.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.750
- Am I?
(Will laughing)

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.370
(adventurous music continues)

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.210
- [Will] There's a new breed of explorers

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.940
taking me to the ends of the earth

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.995
to discover hidden worlds.

00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:20.828
- Ooh!

00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:22.333
- That sit beyond our senses.

00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:26.660
(wind blowing)

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.790
- How's that feeling?

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.601
- Scary as hell. You
know exactly how it feel.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:30.617
(Dwayne laughing)

00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:32.490
(high intensity music)

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.633
- Once you decode the mysteries,

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:39.553
you can find crucial information
about the world around us.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.620
- Ready when you are.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.250
We're trying to see the invisible.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.083
- Wow.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.357
So I could be one of the
first people to ever see this.

00:00:50.357 --> 00:00:51.930
[Diva and Will] - What!

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:54.963
- Inside this sub at 3000 feet.

00:00:55.859 --> 00:00:57.460
- And the only thing protecting you

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.380
is about six inches of plastic.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:01.578
- We down here, y'all. We down here.

00:01:01.578 --> 00:01:02.767
(Diva laughing)

00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:06.553
(music intensifies)

00:01:06.553 --> 00:01:08.153
- [Will] You gotta be kidding me.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:11.230
- That was beautiful.
- Wow.

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:12.170
- Anything dangling?

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:13.003
- Just you.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.410
I'm not going to need
to do that two times.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.107
- No?
(Will laughing)

00:01:20.107 --> 00:01:21.393
- That looks crazy.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.000
There's a different planet down there.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.143
How did I not know that
this was in the world?

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:34.280
(music intensifies)

00:01:40.525 --> 00:01:43.823
Wow. I'm so putting this in a movie.

00:01:43.823 --> 00:01:44.656
(Diva laughing)

00:01:44.656 --> 00:01:46.513
I am so putting this in a movie.

